From: BerryMC <148406068+BerryMC@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:20:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add /rambar and /ping commands

Port the remaining Purpur status commands (via Leaf):

- RamBarTask/RamBarCommand: per-player boss bar showing heap usage.
  Progress is used/max with color thresholds at 50%/75%; the title
  supports <allocated>/<used>/<xmx>/<xms>/<percent> and byte values use
  Purpur's BKMGTPE formatting. Config: rambar.enabled, tick-interval,
  title, progress-color {good,medium,low}.
- PingCommand: /ping [player] shows latency; others require
  dionysus.command.ping.other. Config: ping-command.enabled.

Both bars are driven from the same tick-loop hook as /tpsbar, since
1.12.2 has no Bukkit plugin wrapper to own a scheduler task. Ping uses
Player.Spigot#getPing (not on the Player interface in 1.12.2).

